Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Graveyard_WishOfStrength</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Graveyard_WishOfStrength\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Graveyard_WishOfStrength\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e486c3bf-5aee-40f0-9b56-1ca86187acdc</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e486c3bf-5aee-40f0-9b56-1ca86187acdc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e486c3bf-5aee-40f0-9b56-1ca86187acdc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gorion_Mausoleum\" title=\"Gorion Mausoleum\">Gorion Mausoleum</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My bones ache. Wounds, long-scarred, throb as if new. I long for the comfort of my pipe, and the warmth of the fire. But I cannot stop.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">Gods</a>, old and new, hear me - grant me the strength to keep fighting. The courage to carve out a future for my children. And when I die, the peace that comes with knowing that I did all I could.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214719\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23514/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5603/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935647/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.137      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.137      1 -total\n 53.53%   22.554      6 Template:Icon_text\n 48.54%   20.453     15 Template:Trim\n 27.96%   11.780      2 Template:Uid\n 15.42%    6.499      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.54%    6.126      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.47%    3.992      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.42%    3.970      1 Template:Notes\n  8.79%    3.704      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46908-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214719 and revision id 237289. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}